{
  "description": "A type as the pack writes it (format 1, OBJ frame; only interior, doors and cab matter here) -> its driver's cabs (kinematics.CabArea.of after stock.WagonTypeParser.parse): cabs (how many), cab_of_chair (per cab.seats chair, -1 none), cab_of_piece (per piece of the floor with every door between zones shut, floor_region's pieces in Z order: CabArea.cabAt at its centre, -1 none; [] without a floor), cab_doors (the doors that want the driver's key, as open-door bits), passenger_side_doors [the model's +X side, its -X side] (CabArea.passengerSideDoors), and the answers to the questions, asked in the model frame: cab_at [[x, z]], nearest_chair [[cab, x, z]], cab_door [index], facing [[flipped, chair or -1 for none]], left_side [[flipped, facing]].",
